WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.177
Hi, I'm Chris.

00:00:01.608 --> 00:00:03.004
Let's put Claude on your computer.

00:00:03.578 --> 00:00:07.091
Open your web browser and go to claude.com/download.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:12.114
Pick Mac or Windows, open the file when it finishes, and follow the steps to install it.

00:00:12.662 --> 00:00:15.816
Then open Claude and sign in with Google or your email.

00:00:16.261 --> 00:00:19.346
There's no Claude password, so never give one to anyone.

